Kurzgesagt started out as a small-scale passion&nbsp;
project. But creating animated science videos&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:26.040
that are free for everyone, doesn’t pay the&nbsp;
bills – DAMN YOU reality! In order to make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:31.640
ends meet we had to take on “real jobs” during&nbsp;
the day and create kurzgesagt videos at night.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:36.680
It was tough but our dream of inspiring&nbsp;
people all around the world kept us going.

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:41.680
Then in 2016 everything changed.
Kurzgesagt’s founder, Philipp Dettmer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:45.720
had an idea. He wanted to create something&nbsp;
inspiring that would extend beyond the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:51.160
digital YouTube cosmos. Something tangible.
Something that would represent kurzgesagt’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:56.360
view of the world and our belief in&nbsp;
humanity’s potential for greatness.

00:10:56.360 --> 00:11:02.240
